        &nbsp;<blockquote>
          <p align="left"><font face="Tahoma" size="2">
          <img border="0" src="GrrompGreen.jpg" align="left"><img border="0" src="Logo.jpg" align="center"><br>
          Hail, and welcome to the website for the Clan of Unity.&nbsp; We are 
          an EverQuest guild located on the Karana server.</font></p>
          <p><font face="Tahoma" size="2">We are primarily a social guild, a 
          close-knit group of friends who put a priority on <i>how</i> things 
          are done rather than <i>what</i> things are done.&nbsp; </font><font face="Tahoma" size="2">
          We measure our accomplishments in game by the happiness of our 
          members, not by the value of our bank.</font></p>
          <p><font face="Tahoma" size="2">The best way to get in touch with us 
          is through our forum, which several of our members access daily.&nbsp; 
          If you require our help in any way in game, please contact any of our 
          members, who will gladly put you in touch with an officer.&nbsp; If 
          you need us offline, feel free to send some mail to the
          <a href="mailto:grromp@aol.com?subject=re: CoU Website">fat bear</a>.<br>
          <br>
          Welcome to the other side of normal.&nbsp; The strangest side of 
          Everqeust.&nbsp; Welcome, my friends, to Citanul Suoredrum's Gallery 
          of the <a href="citanul.asp">BIZARRE</a>!<a href="mailto:grromp@aol.com?subject=re: CoU Website"><img border="0" src="Aquin1.jpg" align="right"></a></font></p>
